00:08:15.767 --> 00:08:16.834
-Whoo!

00:08:16.834 --> 00:08:19.167
-♪ You gotta fight ♪

00:08:19.167 --> 00:08:21.367
-♪ For your right ♪

00:08:21.367 --> 00:08:24.167
♪ To party ♪

00:08:25.868 --> 00:08:28.767
-Travis Kelce, everybody!
-Whoo!

00:08:28.767 --> 00:08:30.968
-Catch him hosting
"Saturday Night Live"

00:08:30.968 --> 00:08:34.300
